    <h1>About</h1>

    <p>
      I'm Tin, a full-stack software engineer based in the Boston area. I spend most of my time in
      the .NET world &mdash; building web applications with ASP.NET Core and Angular, modernizing
      legacy code bases, and wiring up CI/CD pipelines in Azure.
    </p>

    <p>
      I graduated summa cum laude from Southeast Missouri State University with a B.S. in Computer
      Science and a minor in Mathematics, finishing with a 3.94 GPA (4.0 in-major) as a Regent's
      Scholarship recipient. Since then I've worked at Itlize Global delivering production
      full-stack features end to end, and previously interned at FPT USA Corp, where I automated
      internal workflows with Selenium.
    </p>

    <p>
      Outside of work I tinker on side projects like Smeexer, an e-commerce prototype for
      mechanical keyboard products, and small Python tools. I enjoy the whole stack: designing an
      API, shaping the frontend that consumes it, and making sure both ship reliably through good
      pipelines.
    </p>

    <h2>Currently</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Software Engineer at Itlize Global (remote)</li>
      <li>Working daily with C#, ASP.NET Core, Angular, TypeScript, SQL, and Azure</li>
      <li>Open to interesting problems &mdash; reach me at
        <a href="mailto:tin.le@gmail.com">tin.le@gmail.com</a></li>
    </ul>
